{
  "project_id": 22,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 10137,
  "title": "What we didn't know about penis anatomy",
  "author": "Diane Kelly",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/diane_kelly_what_we_didn_t_know_about_penis_anatomy",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T06:57:51.597378Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T06:57:51.597378Z",
  "lead_time": 74.391,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "When I go to parties, it doesn't usually take very long for people to find out that I'm a scientist and I study sex.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "424ECEB5EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "And then I get asked questions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18F0CCF9BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "And the questions usually have a very particular format.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9700A6D5A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "They start with the phrase, \"A friend told me,\" and then they end with the phrase, \"Is this true?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0BEA4762DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "And most of the time I'm glad to say that I can answer them, but sometimes I have to say, \"I'm really sorry, but I don't know because I'm not that kind of a doctor.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B117D4633F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "That is, I'm not a clinician, I'm a comparative biologist who studies anatomy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8CBB81DA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 240,
        "text": "And my job is to look at lots of different species of animals and try to figure out how their tissues and organs work when everything's going right, rather than trying to figure out how to fix things when they go wrong, like so many of you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0FF096AC4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "And what I do is I look for similarities and differences in the solutions that they've evolved for fundamental biological problems.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8AE44868E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 254,
        "text": "So today I'm here to argue that this is not at all an esoteric Ivory Tower activity that we find at our universities, but that broad study across species, tissue types and organ systems can produce insights that have direct implications for human health.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "65003D6293",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "And this is true both of my recent project on sex differences in the brain, and my more mature work on the anatomy and function of penises.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2DF7840A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "And now you know why I'm fun at parties.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A8E899294",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 188,
        "text": "(Laughter) So today I'm going to give you an example drawn from my penis study to show you how knowledge drawn from studies of one organ system provided insights into a very different one.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2555AF8F27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 195,
        "text": "Now I'm sure as everyone in the audience already knows -- I did have to explain it to my nine-year-old late last week -- penises are structures that transfer sperm from one individual to another.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21B497CE42",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "And the slide behind me barely scratches the surface of how widespread they are in animals.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35C514995D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "There's an enormous amount of anatomical variation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2F1EADE0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 88,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "inflatable cylinder",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4B90E247B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 140,
        "endOffset": 167,
        "text": "or at least half of you are",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CA7FCB66CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 211,
        "text": "And I think we see this tremendous variation because it's a really effective solution to a very basic biological problem, and that is getting sperm in a position to meet up with eggs and form zygotes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B772D1C50",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Now the penis isn't actually required for internal fertiliztion, but when internal fertilization evolves, penises often follow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "771850B8AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 71,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "What made you interested in this subject?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6008198884",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "And the answer is skeletons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0FBA07620B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "You wouldn't think that skeletons and penises have very much to do with one another.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C818AB154",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "stiff lever systems",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B10F78D127",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "And my first forays into biological research, doing dinosaur paleontology as an undergraduate, were really squarely in that realm.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "758E183DF6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "But when I went to graduate school to study biomechanics, I really wanted to find a dissertation project that would expand our knowledge of skeletal function.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5D4F742AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "I tried a bunch of different stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95C5BAA3DA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "A lot of it didn't pan out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97BE5BDFE2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "But then one day I started thinking about the mammalian penis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "625739A3E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "And it's really an odd sort of structure.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1D249108F8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "Before it can be used for internal fertilization, its mechanical behavior has to change in a really dramatic fashion.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "58B5090BA7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Most of the time it's a flexible organ.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "007138510A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "It's easy to bend.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0AE04D229F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": "it has to become rigid",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DF139D05A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 75,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "it has to become difficult to bend",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E58CE2AE5F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And moreover, it has to work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B055D8A07",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "A reproductive system that fails to function produces an individual that has no offspring, and that individual is then kicked out of the gene pool.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "039B556F8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "cries out for a skeletal system",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1564297D91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "one like this one -- not one like this one",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C94818742D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 138,
        "endOffset": 218,
        "text": "functionally, a skeleton is any system that supports tissue and transmits forces",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "38351BA442",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "And I already knew that animals like this earthworm, indeed most animals, don't support their tissues by draping them over bones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B38AF4588A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "reinforced water balloons",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B24261BE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "They use a skeleton that we call a hydrostatic skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C112B9723E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "And a hydrostatic skeleton uses two elements.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E624AD1BC9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "interaction",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9549E75D79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "And the interaction is crucial.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CEDE35A2E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Without both elements you have no support",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4474413FFA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "a puddle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "746FD5D154",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 96,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "a little wet rag",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9E66B63C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "When you look at a penis in cross section, it has a lot of the hallmarks of a hydrostatic skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F349DC0C9E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 26,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "spongy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C3D63849BE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 185,
        "text": "It has a central space of spongy erectile tissue that fills with fluid -- in this case blood -- surrounded by a wall of tissue that's rich in a stiff structural protein called collagen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0AAB9B3B33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 235,
        "text": "But at the time when I started this project, the best explanation I could find for penal erection was that the wall surrounded these spongy tissues, and the spongy tissues filled with blood and pressure rose and voila! it became erect.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A15E70DC8A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "more fluid, you get tissues that expand",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "56C4CE8438",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "And that explained to me expansion -- made sense: more fluid, you get tissues that expand -- but it didn't actually explain erection.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B68227968",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "Because there was no mechanism in this explanation for making this structure hard to bend.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E95943C9AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "And no one had systematically looked at the wall tissue.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3A9BB32BD1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "wall tissue's important in skeletons",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "880A9A09BA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "So I thought, wall tissue's important in skeletons.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10D4131E27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "It has to be part of the explanation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF14FE8269",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "And this was the point at which my graduate adviser said, \"Whoa!\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A50B068C9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Hold on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA5EB96C6A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Slow down.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "91937C2C9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "Because after about six months of me talking about this, I think he finally figured out that I was really serious about the penis thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "457D5379A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "874A443775",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "So he sat me down, and he warned me.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1BAF03C8CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "He was like, \"Be careful going down this path.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3FB9E49402",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Be careful going down this path",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E17BAB4874",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "I'm not sure this project's going to pan out.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DDC2001D7E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Because he was afraid I was walking into a trap.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "818E267939",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 118,
        "text": "I was taking on a socially embarrassing question with an answer that he thought might not be particularly interesting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10C685EF1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "And that was because every hydrostatic skeleton that we had found in nature up to that point had the same basic elements.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7543B0411E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 164,
        "text": "It had the central fluid, it had the surrounding wall, and the reinforcing fibers in the wall were arranged in crossed helices around the long axis of the skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DF2AB2A503",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "The image behind me shows a piece of tissue in one of these cross helical skeletons cut so that you're looking at the surface of the wall.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "38FA9767E5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "The arrow shows you the long axis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A1E862582",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "And you can see two layers of fibers, one in blue and one in yellow, arranged in left-handed and right-handed angles.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D0BED62B7C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 146,
        "endOffset": 235,
        "text": "something like a Chinese finger trap, where you stick your fingers in and they get stuck.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E2B7C550B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "And these skeletons have a particular set of behaviors, which I'm going to demonstrate in a film.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "08E0CC0885",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "It's a model skeleton that I made out of a piece of cloth that I wrapped around an inflated balloon.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7334DB42E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "The cloth's cut on the bias.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05EA930B24",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "So you can see that the fibers wrap in helices, and those fibers can reorient as the skeleton moves, which means the skeleton's flexible.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "267431947D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "It lengthens, shortens and bends really easily in response to internal or external forces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B30246F295",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "Now my adviser's concern was what if the penile wall tissue is just the same as any other hydrostatic skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A6E00091D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "What are you going to contribute?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B16A83721",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "What new thing are you contributing to our knowledge of biology?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E7F6509CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "And I thought, \"Yeah, he does have a really good point here.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1BB4F18852",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "So I spent a long, long time thinking about it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D0DE6C13D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 71,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "penises don't wiggle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF960A427A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "(Laughter) So something interesting had to be going on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "73976F54FA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 222,
        "text": "So I went ahead, collected wall tissue, prepared it so it was erect, sectioned it, put it on slides and then stuck it under the microscope to have a look, fully expecting to see crossed helices of collagen of some variety.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6561AA4C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "But instead I saw this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EEF249A0FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "There's an outer layer and an inner layer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1142C1F6D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "The arrow shows you the long axis of the skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE2C7C928C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "I was really surprised at this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "825B189FC0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Everyone I showed it was really surprised at this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E94DB132E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "Why was everyone surprised at this?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "19B16836BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 201,
        "text": "That's because we knew theoretically that there was another way of arranging fibers in a hydrostatic skeleton, and that was with fibers at zero degrees and 90 degrees to the long axis of the structure.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E1A49BC00",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "The thing is, no one had ever seen it before in nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C300A116B1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "88",
        "end": "88",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "And now I was looking at one.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9EFE98B2C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "very, very different",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8FC0A16029",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "90",
        "end": "90",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "I'm going to show a model made out of exactly the same materials.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "017CB97ECF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "91",
        "end": "91",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "same cotton cloth, same balloon, same internal pressure",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B708C1A0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "92",
        "end": "92",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "But the only difference is that the fibers are arranged differently.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E3971FD1C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "93",
        "end": "93",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "resists extension and contraction and resists bending",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "85FA17B4D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "94",
        "end": "94",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "Now what that tells us",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DFEEE9C365",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "95",
        "end": "95",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "They're an integral part of the penile skeleton.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7EC59637E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "96",
        "end": "96",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 197,
        "text": "If the wall around the erectile tissue wasn't there, if it wasn't reinforced in this way, the shape would change, but the inflated penis would not resist bending, and erection simply wouldn't work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABB504AC98",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "97",
        "end": "97",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 236,
        "text": "It's an observation with obvious medical applications in humans as well, but it's also relevant in a broad sense, I think, to the design of prosthetics, soft robots, basically anything where changes of shape and stiffness are important.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "804A30AE46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "98",
        "end": "98",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 177,
        "text": "So to sum up: Twenty years ago, I had a college adviser tell me, when I went to the college and said, \"I'm kind of interested in anatomy,\" they said, \"Anatomy's a dead science.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E78219F4BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "99",
        "end": "99",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "He couldn't have been more wrong.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DDB7EC535D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "100",
        "end": "100",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "I really believe that we still have a lot to learn about the normal structure and function of our bodies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B4DC6CA9DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "101",
        "end": "101",
        "startOffset": 55,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "up here in the meat end of the scale",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "15BDDCCF03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "102",
        "end": "102",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "We've got limits on our time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B7FD1E11A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "103",
        "end": "103",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 181,
        "text": "We often focus on one disease, one model, one problem, but my experience suggests that we should take the time to apply ideas broadly between systems and just see where it takes us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "767FBF8943",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "104",
        "end": "104",
        "startOffset": 123,
        "endOffset": 211,
        "text": "lots of other wild and productive connections lurking out there just waiting to be found",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5EEDE748D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "105",
        "end": "105",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D867974109",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "106",
        "end": "106",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
